        "Schwanenritter",
        "Schwanenritters",
        "Swan Knights"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Anfortas: Schwanenritter",
      "content": "The Schwanenritter (\"Swan Knights\" in German) were a knightly order of Khaenri'ah's Eclipse Dynasty era, led by Knight Marshal Anfortas. They fought the dark beasts of the cataclysm and brought Khaenri'ahn survivors aboveground to Sumeru, using Ruin Golems of an older design. Named members include Hadura, Hildric (\"Beard-Father\") and Ynghildr (\"Damsel of the Dale\"). The Order of Skeptics honoured them as heroes of Dahri.",
