    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Hadura",
        "Sentinel of the Golden Hall"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Anfortas: Hadura",
      "content": "Hadura was a Knight Commander of the Schwanenritter, honoured as \"Sentinel of the Golden Hall\" for stalling the Abyssal beasts, and one of the last two knights alive. They betrayed the order by destroying a machine beyond repair, and Anfortas executed them, losing his left eye. Their motive is unrecorded. A later Order of Skeptics member, Klingsor, claimed Hadura as an ancestor.",
