    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "In the Name of Anfortas",
        "Cryptic Message in Sumeru"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Anfortas: In the Name of Anfortas",
      "content": "A hidden exploration objective in Sumeru: five damaged Ruin Guards near Dharma Forest carry fragments of an enciphered message, and the cipher's key is the name ANFORTAS. Decoded, the message states that the Schwanenritters fought to the last one. Finishing it grants the achievement \"In the Name of Anfortas\".",
